  "reference_prompt": "Extract and reconstruct ONE broad two-storey Chinese timber main hall based on the large right-side architecture behind the woman in the reference. Preserve its sweeping blue-grey tiled hip-and-gable roofs with strongly upturned eaves, ridge ornaments, dark weathered timber, muted ochre-gold columns, dougong brackets, lattice windows and balcony railings. Wide rectangular mass, two floors with an open central front doorway, shallow stone plinth and short front steps. Light irregular snow on roof tiles and ledges, visible tile courses. Complete hidden parts coherently. Isolated whole building, near-front three-quarter view showing a little right side, long-lens perspective, entire silhouette with padding. Realistic material details, neutral diffuse studio light, plain light grey background. No people, dragon, bridge, ropes, neighboring buildings, mountains, floating elements, text, watermark or collage. Exactly one standalone building for 3D reconstruction.",
